sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Main as main.rs
    participant Classify as classify.rs
    participant GitHub as github.rs
    participant Discovery as discovery.rs
    participant Retry as retry.rs
    participant Model as model.rs

    User->>Main: Run ghlinks\n--input links.txt\n--output report.json
    Main->>Main: Read links.txt
    Main->>Classify: classify(urls)
    Classify-->>Main: LinkKind list

    loop For each LinkKind, concurrently
        Main->>GitHub: fetch metadata\n(repos/gists/pages)
        GitHub->>Retry: should_retry? / backoff_delay?
        Retry-->>GitHub: retry decision
        GitHub-->>Main: RepoData/GistData or fetch_errors entry

        alt external discovery enabled
            Main->>Discovery: fetch external mentions\n(Hacker News)
            Discovery->>Retry: should_retry? / backoff_delay?
            Retry-->>Discovery: retry decision
            Discovery-->>Main: ExternalMention list or fetch_errors entry
        else external discovery disabled (--skip-external)
            Main-->>Main: Skip discovery
        end

        Main->>Model: assemble LinkRecord\n(RepoData/GistData,\nExternalMention, fetch_errors)
        Model-->>Main: LinkRecord
        Note over Main: A per-link failure is recorded\nin that record's fetch_errors;\nit does not abort the batch run.
    end

    Main->>Main: Assemble Report\n(schema_version, run_summary, records)\nand serialize as JSON
    Main-->>User: report.json
